'''Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Osaka''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 582
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Osaka
|name2 = Hatsune Miku CC: MM2020 Osaka
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hatsune Miku CC: MM2020 Osaka''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is a glass cannon who works similarly to [[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]]. Her 10% chance for a Savage Blow increases her effective DPS to that of a normal specialised nuker, but is unreliable. Luckily, it can come in handy if it happens to trigger at the right time. This unit is not recommended to be used against [[General GreGory|rusher]] [[Razorback|enemies]], [[:Category:Long Distance Enemies|Long Distance enemies]] or [[:Category:Wave Attack Enemies|Wave attackers]], because of her low health.

Due to her low damage, this unit is not recommended for general use, but can still be helpful early on against enemies that [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can barely not outrange, such as [[THE SLOTH]].

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Backliner}}

